        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "step-3",
      "heading": "Brown the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan over medium-high. Add the chicken, season and fry for 6–8 minutes, turning occasionally, until browned."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Brown the chicken",
          "seconds": [
            360,
            480
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "chicken-korma-green-beans-3-sketch",
        "path": "media/chicken-korma-green-beans-3-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Brown the chicken",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "step-4",
      "heading": "Fry the beans and spices",
      "blocks": [
        "Add the shallot and green beans and fry for 3–4 minutes until softened. Add the korma paste and fry for 1 minute."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Soften the vegetables",
          "seconds": [
            180,
            240
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "timer-2",
          "label": "Fry the paste",
          "seconds": [
            60
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "chicken-korma-green-beans-4-sketch",
        "path": "media/chicken-korma-green-beans-4-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Fry the beans and spices",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "step-5",
      "heading": "Simmer the curry",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir the stock paste, crème fraîche, {{sugar}} sugar and {{curry-water}} water into the chicken and bring to a boil. Simmer for 5–6 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the beans are tender and the chicken is cooked through. Taste, season and thin with a splash of water if needed."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
